  "title": "Beef Bourguignon II",
  "description": "Stewing meat is browned and braised in red wine with carrots, garlic, onions, and herbs. Mushrooms and more onions are added for the last half hour of cooking.",
  "authors": [
    "Teri Smith"
  ],
